   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_f188faf3aea2847361b8",
   "sourceHash": "f188faf3aea2847361b8459c7939dc45c08587fc40bf5bb72069982f7da9ba24",
   "text": "Votre itinéraire jusqu'au Healing Village",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_6e57f2c60d8fb1519db1",
   "sourceHash": "6e57f2c60d8fb1519db151fbef00ba9bc2ad66e73296cfa9d07334fe2f780ec2",
   "text": "Kairali – The Ayurvedic Healing Village est un hôpital ayurvédique accrédité NABH situé près de Palakkad, au Kerala, dans le sud de l'Inde. Cette page vous indique quel aéroport choisir, comment fonctionnent nos transferts et ce qui vous attend précisément dès votre atterrissage.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_0533ad6a08f2b0185097",
   "sourceHash": "0533ad6a08f2b018509791d69ac5f086ad307719024568bf86ae8767059fa120",
   "text": "Accès · Itinéraire",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_d62f3c08ef75c768fcb2",
   "sourceHash": "d62f3c08ef75c768fcb265df2d1713442c954082d15429180f12cc10fd9fe16b",
   "text": "III/73 Palayamkadu, P.O. Olassery, Kodumbu, Palakkad District – 678551, Kerala, India",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": "Postal address kept exactly as in the source for courier use.",
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_f58f6d5a4b0ab6fa4af9",
   "sourceHash": "f58f6d5a4b0ab6fa4af995beb9447e7739e6ae33fc71f8aca3ddc2f9f9139438",
   "text": "Horaires téléphoniques : 8:00 AM–9:00 PM IST, tous les jours",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_6ad517028fa954322656",
   "sourceHash": "6ad517028fa954322656645e50ecf5c5c0120af97b9ac96e9f04031337f49b85",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]Organiser un transfert sur WhatsApp[[CLOSE_1]] [[OPEN_2]]Appeler le standard[[CLOSE_2]]",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_2adc964c084749b1f2d8",
   "sourceHash": "2adc964c084749b1f2d8aef24030988b667dbda2e38a6a1699556c93e07c1cea",
   "text": "Commencez ici",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_e6a1cbe46e5406975ebf",
   "sourceHash": "e6a1cbe46e5406975ebf13ece37b89600171cdf56491c9a619dd3549a66f232c",
   "text": "Le moyen le plus simple de nous rejoindre",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_176ae01054c30573c0e3",
   "sourceHash": "176ae01054c30573c0e3b301139462f8b8ec315d03aff2d4f6595af0f33353e9",
   "text": "Vous arrivez de l'étranger",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_84332aded5c237c44add",
   "sourceHash": "84332aded5c237c44add91c89203896e30c72b325ec9952d9006e6e821d04116",
   "text": "Prenez un vol pour Coimbatore (CJB)",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_2e2e044835ee0adb68ff",
   "sourceHash": "2e2e044835ee0adb68ff498bc0050a779078a88d82f6ac1a0d5d688ac4063d8a",
   "text": "L'aéroport le plus proche — environ 1½–2 heures de transfert en voiture privée. Kochi / Cochin (COK) est une bonne alternative lorsqu'il offre de meilleures correspondances depuis votre pays — environ 2½–3 heures de route.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_bc67d7f3c7dfc2f397e0",
   "sourceHash": "bc67d7f3c7dfc2f397e0e8d5f594b227cbf894d80a63dd06eeffa02f6f3986fa",
   "text": "Vous êtes déjà en Inde",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_8566af9c5b8b351ff6bc",
   "sourceHash": "8566af9c5b8b351ff6bc4a6e643a01296630781561dfd55a1e9a873e70980801",
   "text": "Palakkad Junction (PGT)",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": "Proper name of the railway station with its code.",
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_40f800aa3a253b152355",
   "sourceHash": "40f800aa3a253b1523559c67f8dfcf73798a2e74c9a9a3d344c151507fe139e0",
   "text": "La gare la plus proche, à environ 35 minutes — ou venez en voiture par l'axe NH544 Coimbatore–Kochi.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_d603acfd5067210c534e",
   "sourceHash": "d603acfd5067210c534ef9ff7147167ab7422ad2ec70d1d005f66566f15077bb",
   "text": "L'aéroport de Coimbatore se trouve dans l'État voisin du Tamil Nadu ; l'hôpital est au Kerala. Votre transfert franchit la frontière entre les deux États par la route — c'est une formalité courante qui ne demande aucune démarche supplémentaire.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_ad0af097cd5bed45d15b",
   "sourceHash": "ad0af097cd5bed45d15bd06ce633cd21ec835f311fef2ec8a4cd64307aaafdcc",
   "text": "Organiser un transfert sur WhatsApp",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_487b8b4f2f4e3802b541",
   "sourceHash": "487b8b4f2f4e3802b541a474aa507954b7d2e970b8a622ce326e43db228eb9aa",
   "text": "Quatre étapes, du sous-continent jusqu'à notre entrée",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_d004064f5d3a3de0558d",
   "sourceHash": "d004064f5d3a3de0558d1cdfe9efc0479dc62ca383277d38447b1374202fa4aa",
   "text": "Le Kerala se situe sur la côte sud-ouest de l'Inde. Le district de Palakkad est à l'intérieur des terres, à la frontière entre le Kerala et le Tamil Nadu, au pied des Ghâts occidentaux. Les deux aéroports que vous utiliserez probablement sont Coimbatore (CJB, au Tamil Nadu, le plus proche) et Kochi / Cochin (COK, au Kerala) — tous deux reliés à l'hôpital par un transfert routier simple.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
